{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Search for object, if seen then move to it and inspect; if not, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
